  "html": "<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Character class provides a character's most exciting capabilities. This chapter offers twelve classes, each of which contains four subclasses—all summarized below.</p>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-barbarian-xphb\">Barbarian</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Storm with Rage, and wade into hand-to-hand combat. Then follow the Path of the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Barbarian to unleash raw violence.</li>\n  <li>Barbarian to manifest kinship with animals.</li>\n  <li>Barbarian to tap into cosmic vitality.</li>\n  <li>Barbarian to rage in union with a god.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-bard-xphb\">Bard</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Perform spells that inspire and heal allies or beguile foes. Then join the College of...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Bard to harness agility in battle.</li>\n  <li>Bard to weave beguiling Feywild magic.</li>\n  <li>Bard to collect knowledge and magical secrets.</li>\n  <li>Bard to wield weapons with spells.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-cleric-xphb\">Cleric</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Invoke divine magic to heal, bolster, and smite. Then harness the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Cleric to be a master of healing.</li>\n  <li>Cleric to wield searing, warding light.</li>\n  <li>Cleric to bedevil foes with mischief.</li>\n  <li>Cleric to inspire valor and chastise foes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-druid-xphb\">Druid</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Channel nature magic to heal, shape-shift, and control the elements. Then join the Circle of the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Druid to draw on the magic of the environment.</li>\n  <li>Druid to adopt powerful animal forms.</li>\n  <li>Druid to channel tides and storms.</li>\n  <li>Druid to gain powers in a starry form.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-fighter-xphb\">Fighter</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Master all weapons and armor. Then embody the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Fighter to use special combat maneuvers.</li>\n  <li>Fighter to strive for peak combat prowess.</li>\n  <li>Fighter to learn spells to aid in combat.</li>\n  <li>Fighter to augment attacks with psionic power.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-monk-xphb\">Monk</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Dart in and out of melee while striking fast and hard. Then become a Warrior of...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Monk to heal or harm with a touch.</li>\n  <li>Monk to employ shadows for subterfuge.</li>\n  <li>Monk to wield elemental power.</li>\n  <li>Monk to master unarmed combat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-paladin-xphb\">Paladin</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Smite foes and shield allies with divine and martial might. Then swear the Oath of...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Paladin to emulate the angels of justice.</li>\n  <li>Paladin to reach the heights of heroism.</li>\n  <li>Paladin to preserve life, joy, and nature.</li>\n  <li>Paladin to hunt down evildoers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-ranger-xphb\">Ranger</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Weave together martial prowess, nature magic, and survival skills. Then embody the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Ranger to bond with a primal beast.</li>\n  <li>Ranger to manifest fey mirth and fury.</li>\n  <li>Ranger to hunt foes that lurk in darkness.</li>\n  <li>Ranger to protect nature with martial versatility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-rogue-xphb\">Rogue</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Launch deadly Sneak Attacks while avoiding harm through stealth. Then embody the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Rogue to enhance stealth with spells.</li>\n  <li>Rogue to deliver ambushes and poison.</li>\n  <li>Rogue to strike foes with psi blades.</li>\n  <li>Rogue to master infiltration and treasure hunting.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-sorcerer-xphb\">Sorcerer</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Wield magic innate to your being, shaping the power to your will. Then channel...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Sorcerer to use strange psionic magic.</li>\n  <li>Sorcerer to harness cosmic forces of order.</li>\n  <li>Sorcerer to breathe the magic of dragons.</li>\n  <li>Sorcerer to unleash chaos magic.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-warlock-xphb\">Warlock</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Cast spells derived from occult knowledge. Then form a pact with the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Warlock to teleport and wield fey magic.</li>\n  <li>Warlock to heal with heavenly magic.</li>\n  <li>Warlock to call on sinister powers.</li>\n  <li>Warlock to delve into forbidden lore.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"class-wizard-xphb\">Wizard</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">Study arcane magic and master spells for every purpose. Then embody the...</p>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li>Wizard to shield allies and banish foes.</li>\n  <li>Wizard to learn the multiverse's secrets.</li>\n  <li>Wizard to create explosive effects.</li>\n  <li>Wizard to weave spells of deception.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"barbarian\">Barbarian</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"bard\">Bard</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"cleric\">Cleric</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"druid\">Druid</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"fighter\">Fighter</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"monk\">Monk</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"paladin\">Paladin</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"ranger\">Ranger</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"rogue\">Rogue</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"sorcerer\">Sorcerer</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"warlock\">Warlock</h3>\n<h3 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"wizard\">Wizard</h3>\n"
